{"sourceUrl":"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2625.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.652155+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2625.htm","html":"<div>\n<h5>电信学部微电子学院2025年（第六届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知</h5>\n<h6>日期：2025-05-29    点击数：    来源：\r\n    </h6>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>      为了促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，</span></span><span><span>西安交通大学</span></span><span><span>电子与信息学部微电子学院</span></span><span><span>将于</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7月</span></span></strong><span><span>举办</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>微电子学院</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生暑</span></span><span><span>期</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span><span>”活动，旨</span></span><span><span>在搭建学院与学生交流互动</span></span><span><span>平台，使学生</span></span><span><span>充分</span></span><span><span>了解</span></span><span><span>微电子学院</span></span><span><span>。期间学员有机会</span></span><span><span>了解学院研究生招生政策，</span></span><span><span>聆听</span></span><span><span>知名</span></span><span><span>学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受</span></span><span><span>微电子</span></span><span><span>学院良好的教学科研氛围</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>学院将根据</span></span><span><span>报名营员</span></span><span><span>申请材料</span></span><span><span>及夏令营期间的</span></span><span><span>表现选拔合格的营员，</span></span><span><span>为其</span></span><span><span>提供相应的研究生招生优惠政策。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>一、活动形式及时间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>线上举办，详情参见后续通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>活动时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年7月</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>二、活动内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      1、学院介绍：学院历史、学科简介，人才培养、教学及科研等情况介绍</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2、专题宣讲：各科研方向负责人介绍研究内容、专业实验室情况和研究生就业去向等，加深对相关专业情况的了解。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>三、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      1、申请者应是集成电路科学与工程、电子科学与技术相关专业202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2、所在学校为双一流大学建设高校，或所在专业在最新一轮学科评估中排名B+及以上学科；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      3、综合成绩排名在专业前20%；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      4、</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      5、鼓励符合条件的本校微电子相关专业同学积极报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>四、申请流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      1、报名时间</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>6月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span>-6月1</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2、注册</span></span><span><span>填报：登录西安交通大学夏令营报名系统（</span><a href=\"http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/</a>），</span><span><span>报名项目选自</span><span>“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，</span></span><span><span>注册获取报名号，用报名号登录系统，认真填写相关信息后</span></span><span><span>并上传材料后，</span></span><span><span>保存提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      3、上传材料：请申请者在网申系统提交以下申请材料的彩色扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      1）学生证及身份证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2）加盖申请人所在学校/院教务处公章的截止目前的本科正式成绩单；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      3）英语四、六级证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      4）在校期间，如获得过奖励、发表学术论文、出版物或其它学术工作成果、社会实践鉴定等，请提供相应证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>      <span>5）《电信学部微电子学院-202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（</span></span><span><span>在附件</span></span><span><span>下载）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      4、材料审核：学院于6月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日前组织专家对报名材料进行审核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      5、学生确认：入营学员于6月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日前在报名端确认是否参加，逾期不确认者视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      6</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>名单公示：入营名单将在微电子学院官网通知公告栏公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>         <span>特别说明：系统报名，无需邮寄纸质材料！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>其他安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年微电子学院夏令营期间不组织相关面试，不评选优秀营员。夏令营开营后，入营营员可与意向报考团队或导师联系，与团队或导师进行深入交流和实践，表现突出的营员可获得团队或老师的推荐。</span></span><span><span>具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>六、注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未在规定时间内审核确认者视为自动放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学生应全程参加夏令营各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>如果发现材料弄虚作假，学院将取消或者追回夏令营活动中获得的权益，并保留追诉的权利。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      4</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未能参加夏令营的同学，仍可参加学院后期的</span></span><span><span>推免相关招生活动</span></span><span><span>报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>        <span>七、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>      地址：陕西省西安市碑林区咸宁西路</span><span>28号西安交通大学电信学部-微电子学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      联系人：田老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      办公电话：</span><span>029-82663426</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:ele@xjtu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ele@xjtu.edu.cn</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      学院主页：</span><span><a href=\"http://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      更多相关内容关注西安交通大学微电子学院主页相关的招生信息。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>西安交通大学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电信学部微电子学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>5月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div><div></div>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>附件【<a href=\"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1585396097&amp;wbfileid=16431353\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电信学部微电子学院-2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表.docx</a>】已下载<span></span>次</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<b></b>\n<div>\n<p>\n<span>上一条：</span><a href=\"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2631.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">西安交通大学电信学部微电子学院2025年非全日制工程博士招生补录名单公示</a></p>\n<p> <span>下一条：</span><a href=\"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2622.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">西安交通大学电信学部微电子学院2025年博士招生秋季资格考核拟录取名单公示</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>【<a>关闭</a>】</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"aa60b12b33a6e7026c6024392f72aa9525f28106328b7254ee56a4a348bf361e","textLength":1489,"sourceSha256":"4c0b65be294253161f7281dd2946aeea152906bebc932a675d34554ccf7f9eb4","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cc47550997312d1ac3bc","title":"2025年西安交通大学电子与信息学部微电子学院2025年（第六届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.652155+00:00"}
